{"id":416611,"date":"2026-10-29T11:24:12","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T09:24:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/?p=416611"},"modified":"2026-10-29T11:24:19","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T09:24:19","slug":"criterii-burse-sociale-pentru-studenti-in-2026-2027-din-fonduri-europene-varsta-18-29-de-ani-studii-la-buget-si-cu-frecventa-venituri-sub-plafon-situatii-medicale-studenti-orfani-sau-din-famili","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/criterii-burse-sociale-pentru-studenti-in-2026-2027-din-fonduri-europene-varsta-18-29-de-ani-studii-la-buget-si-cu-frecventa-venituri-sub-plafon-situatii-medicale-studenti-orfani-sau-din-famili\/","title":{"rendered":"Criterii burse sociale pentru studen\u021bi \u00een 2026-2027, din fonduri europene: v\u00e2rsta 18-29 de ani, studii la buget \u0219i cu frecven\u021b\u0103 \/ Venituri sub plafon, situa\u021bii medicale, studen\u021bi orfani sau din familii monoparentale, conform metodologiei"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h5 id=\"peste-36-000-de-studenti-din-medii-si-grupuri-dezavantajate-vor-putea-beneficia-de-burse-sociale-din-fonduri-europene-in-anul-universitar-2026-2027-a-anuntat-unitatea-executiva-pentru-finantarea-inva\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Peste 36.000 de studen\u021bi din medii \u0219i grupuri dezavantajate vor putea beneficia de burse sociale din fonduri europene \u00een anul universitar 2026-2027, <a href=\"https:\/\/uefiscdi.gov.ro\/news-bursele-sociale-din-fonduri-europene-continua-si-in-anul-universitar-2026-2027#s\">a anun\u021bat<\/a> Unitatea Executiv\u0103 pentru Finan\u021barea \u00cenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2ntului Superior, a Cercet\u0103rii, Dezvolt\u0103rii \u0219i Inov\u0103rii (UEFISCDI) pe 28 octombrie<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bursele vor fi acordate \u00een cuantum integral, indiferent de num\u0103rul de zile cu activit\u0103\u021bi didactice din luna respectiv\u0103. Pentru a beneficia de sprijin prin proiect, studen\u021bii trebuie s\u0103 aib\u0103 \u00eentre 18 \u0219i 29 de ani, s\u0103 fie la licen\u021b\u0103 sau master, la forma de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt cu frecven\u021b\u0103, pe un loc finan\u021bat de la buget \u0219i \u00eentr-o universitate civil\u0103 de stat selectat\u0103 \u00een proiect.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Selec\u021bia va fi ref\u0103cut\u0103 inclusiv pentru studen\u021bii care au primit burs\u0103 social\u0103 anul trecut.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cuantumul minim al bursei sociale pentru studen\u021bi este de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/oficial-burse-pentru-studenti-in-anul-universitar-2026-2027-minimum-925-de-lei-bursa-sociala-si-3-700-de-lei-bursa-de-doctorat\/\">925 de lei \u00een anul universitar 2026-2027<\/a><\/strong>, potrivit Ordinului ministrului Educa\u021biei \u0219i Cercet\u0103rii nr. 5.732, publicat \u00een Monitorul Oficial pe 30 septembrie.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"peste-36-000-de-studenti-vor-beneficia-de-burse-sociale\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Peste 36.000 de studen\u021bi vor beneficia de burse sociale<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Num\u0103rul total al beneficiarilor va fi de peste 36.000 de studen\u021bi, \u201ecel pu\u021bin la nivelul anului universitar 2025-2026\u201d, conform UEFISCDI.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bursele vor fi acordate \u00een cuantum integral, indiferent de num\u0103rul de zile \u00een care sunt programate activit\u0103\u021bi didactice \u00een luna respectiv\u0103.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"cine-poate-primi-bursa-sociala-din-fonduri-europene\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cine poate primi bursa social\u0103 din fonduri europene<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pentru a primi burs\u0103 social\u0103 prin acest proiect, studen\u021bii trebuie s\u0103 \u00eendeplineasc\u0103 <strong>cumulativ<\/strong> cinci condi\u021bii:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>s\u0103 aib\u0103 \u00eentre 18 \u0219i 29 de ani la data \u00eenscrierii \u00een grupul-\u021bint\u0103 al proiectului;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>s\u0103 fie \u00eenmatricula\u021bi la un program de studii de licen\u021b\u0103 sau de masterat;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>s\u0103 urmeze forma de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt cu frecven\u021b\u0103;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>s\u0103 studieze pe un loc finan\u021bat de la bugetul de stat;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>s\u0103 fie \u00eenmatricula\u021bi \u00eentr-o institu\u021bie de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt superior civil\u0103 de stat selectat\u0103 pentru acordarea burselor sociale \u00een cadrul proiectului.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"studentii-eligibili-pentru-burse-sociale-potrivit-criteriilor-generale\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Studen\u021bii eligibili pentru burse sociale, potrivit criteriilor generale<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Selec\u021bia beneficiarilor se face de c\u0103tre universit\u0103\u021bi cu respectarea criteriilor generale de acordare a burselor, aprobate prin <a href=\"https:\/\/legislatie.just.ro\/Public\/DetaliiDocumentAfis\/300123\">Ordinul Ministerului Educa\u021biei nr. 6.463\/2023<\/a>, cu modific\u0103rile \u0219i complet\u0103rile ulterioare, precum \u0219i a metodologiilor proprii ale institu\u021biilor de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt superior.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Potrivit art. 10 alin. (9) din ordin, printre beneficiarii burselor sociale pot fi:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>a) Studen\u021bii orfani de unul sau ambii p\u0103rin\u021bi, cei din familii monoparentale sau proveni\u021bi din centre de plasament<\/strong>, dac\u0103 nu realizeaz\u0103 venituri peste plafonul stabilit pentru acordarea bursei sociale.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>b) Studen\u021bii cu anumite afec\u021biuni medicale<\/strong>, f\u0103r\u0103 a fi luat \u00een considerare nivelul venitului mediu pe membru de familie. Sunt enumerate:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>tuberculoza, pe perioada tratamentului tuberculostatic;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>diabetul insulinonecesitant;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>bolile maligne;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>sindroamele de malabsorb\u021bie severe;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>boala cronic\u0103 de rinichi \u00een program de dializ\u0103;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>astmul bron\u0219ic persistent moderat sau sever;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>epilepsia grand mal;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>cardiopatiile congenitale;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>hepatita cronic\u0103 cu fibroz\u0103 avansat\u0103, stadiul F3 sau F4;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>glaucomul;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>miopia grav\u0103;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>bolile imunologice autoimune \u00een forme severe;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>bolile rare;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>tulbur\u0103rile din spectrul autist;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>bolile hematologice severe care necesit\u0103 tratament continuu sau spitaliz\u0103ri frecvente;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>surditatea bilateral\u0103;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>fibroza chistic\u0103;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>infec\u021bia cu HIV sau SIDA;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>deficien\u021bele locomotorii severe.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>c) Studen\u021bii din familii cu venituri reduse<\/strong>, respectiv cei a c\u0103ror familie nu a realizat, \u00een cele 12 luni anterioare \u00eenceperii semestrului\/anului universitar, un venit lunar net mediu pe membru de familie mai mare dec\u00e2t salariul de baz\u0103 minim net pe economie.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"se-face-o-noua-selectie-si-pentru-studentii-care-au-primit-bursa-anul-trecut\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Se face o nou\u0103 selec\u021bie \u0219i pentru studen\u021bii care au primit burs\u0103 anul trecut<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Beneficiarii nu sunt selecta\u021bi direct de UEFISCDI, ci de universit\u0103\u021bi.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Un element important pentru anul universitar 2026-2027 este c\u0103 institu\u021biile de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt superior trebuie s\u0103 fac\u0103 <strong>o nou\u0103 selec\u021bie a beneficiarilor<\/strong>, inclusiv \u00een cazul studen\u021bilor care au beneficiat de burs\u0103 social\u0103 \u00een anul universitar precedent.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Studen\u021bii trebuie s\u0103 se adreseze universit\u0103\u021bii la care sunt \u00eenmatricula\u021bi \u0219i s\u0103 respecte calendarul \u0219i procedura stabilite de institu\u021bia respectiv\u0103.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"calendarul-si-procedurile-vor-fi-anuntate-ulterior\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Calendarul \u0219i procedurile vor fi anun\u021bate ulterior<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">UEFISCDI nu a publicat deocamdat\u0103 calendarul detaliat pentru acordarea burselor \u00een anul universitar 2026-2027.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eToate informa\u021biile referitoare la acordarea burselor sociale \u00een cadrul proiectului (calendarul detaliat, procedurile administrative pentru universit\u0103\u021bi \u0219i studen\u021bi etc.) vor fi comunicate \u00een perioada urm\u0103toare, pe canalele de comunicare ale proiectului \u0219i prin intermediul universit\u0103\u021bilor\u201d, precizeaz\u0103 institu\u021bia.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"webinare-si-workshopuri-pentru-studentii-beneficiari\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Webinare \u0219i workshopuri pentru studen\u021bii beneficiari<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pe l\u00e2ng\u0103 sprijinul financiar, studen\u021bii selecta\u021bi vor avea acces \u0219i la m\u0103suri complementare.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">UEFISCDI anun\u021b\u0103 webinare \u0219i workshopuri online pe teme legate de parcursul universitar, printre care gestionarea timpului, gestionarea stresului academic \u0219i dezvoltarea competen\u021belor de \u00eenv\u0103\u021bare.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Activitatea face parte din proiectul \u201eInterven\u021bii pentru \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2ntul ter\u021biar \u2013 m\u0103suri sistemice pentru prevenirea \u0219i reducerea abandonului universitar\u201d, cod SMIS 322473, implementat de UEFISCDI \u00een parteneriat cu Ministerul Educa\u021biei \u0219i Cercet\u0103rii \u0219i cofinan\u021bat din Fondul Social European+ \u0219i din bugetul na\u021bional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:14px\">Foto: \u00a9 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/young-redhead-woman-business-worker-counting-romanian-leu-banknotes-office-image283574431\">Aaron Amat | Dreamstime.com<\/a> \/ <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/\">Dreamstime.com<\/a> sprijin\u0103 educa\u0163ia din Rom\u00e2nia \u015fi ofer\u0103 gratuit imagini stock prin care <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/\">Edupedu.ro<\/a> \u00ee\u015fi poate ilustra articolele c\u00e2t mai relevant posibil \/ Campania Back to school ofer\u0103 posibilitatea oric\u0103rei \u0219coli, profesor sau elev <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/schooliscool#ref7703602\">s\u0103 descarce imagini de calitate cu 50% discount<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"Peste 36.000 de studen\u021bi din medii \u0219i grupuri dezavantajate vor putea beneficia de burse sociale din fonduri europene \u00een anul universitar 2026-2027, a anun\u021bat Unitatea Executiv\u0103 pentru Finan\u021barea \u00cenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2ntului Superior,&hellip;\n","protected":false},"author":184,"featured_media":258592,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_publicize_message":"","jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled":true,"jetpack_social_post_already_shared":true,"jetpack_social_options":{"image_generator_settings":{"template":"highway","default_image_id":0,"font":"","enabled":false},"version":2}},"categories":[647,25],"tags":[136851,123314,122594,136849,136847,136850,103994,126406,125,3035,136848],"class_list":["post-416611","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","category-stiri","category-universitate","tag-abandon-universita","tag-an-universitar-2026-2027","tag-burse-din-fonduri-europene","tag-burse-medicale-studenti","tag-burse-sociale-studenti-2","tag-burse-studenti-2026-2027","tag-criterii-burse-sociale","tag-invatamant-superior-2","tag-studenti","tag-uefiscdi","tag-venituri-studenti-2"],"jetpack_publicize_connections":[],"views":{"total":1561,"cached_at":"","cached_date":1793428445},"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/pajIe6-1Knx","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_likes_enabled":true,"amp_enabled":true,"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/dreamstime_s_283574431.jpg","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416611","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/184"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=416611"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416611\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":416615,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416611\/revisions\/416615"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/258592"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=416611"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=416611"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=416611"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}